msgid "Chapters are cached for one year; study texts for 90 days. Catalogs are checked daily. Cached content is retained during outages. Changed content revisions refresh chapters on demand. Manual refresh replaces each response only after a successful download. WordPress scheduled tasks need site visits or a configured cron runner."
